The following TypeScript files are copied from Foliole's source and retain
their original implementation:
  unifiedPushQueueRules.ts
  unifiedPushQueueAssembler.ts
  readingMaterialDispersion.ts
  hierarchicalMaterialInterleave.ts
  balancedMaterialMerge.ts
  materialInterleaveHeap.ts

Integration is in ../../study/study.ts. The application assembles separate
reading and FSRS queues from bounded SQLite candidate batches and uses its
own storage and scheduling actions.
